    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "idk if talking helps. it just feels like i'm trying to fix something that's fundamentally broken. like, no matter what i do, i'm still just... this. it's exhausting trying to pretend things are okay when they're just not. it feels like i've been running a race for years and i'm just completely out of breath.",
